   "args_order": null,
   "source": "This is one of Grgglck's tentacles. It looks more vulnerable than the main body.",
   "target": "这是格尔格勒克的一条触手。它看起来比主体更加脆弱。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/general/npcs/horror.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
